{"timestamp":"2026-08-24T21:46:52.703Z","ordinal":9694,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a025ce-e754-7631-8467-eaa6035ba0f8","turn_id":"01a035bb-e411-7b32-a380-13e06970de42","item":{"type":"Reasoning","id":"rs_068dffc2438c6825016a8cbbc7f1a887d095a084b32d0809d8","summary_text":[],"raw_content":[]},"started_at_ms":1787608007965,"completed_at_ms":1787608012703}}
{"timestamp":"2026-08-24T21:46:52.706Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"id":"rs_068dffc2438c6825016a8cbbc7f1a887d095a084b32d0809d8","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a035bb-e411-7b32-a380-13e06970de42"},"summary":[],"type":"reasoning"}}
{"timestamp":"2026-08-24T21:46:54.547Z","ordinal":9696,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a025ce-e754-7631-8467-eaa6035ba0f8","turn_id":"01a035bb-e411-7b32-a380-13e06970de42","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_068dffc2438c6825016a8cbbccadec87d0bee91748ca04236c","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The design now keeps the product contract intact:\n\n- pre-push still offers Yes / Not now / Always;\n- `entire trust` and `--revoke` remain;\n- checkpoint egress still holds until consent and drains after consent;\n- Claude Code retains its current lifecycle/tool matchers;\n- Gemini retains all twelve current hook entries.\n\nOnly `enable --global`, `disable --global`, and the ask-once global-enable wizard are removed. The brainstorming review gate calls for rechecking a materially revised spec, so I’m doing that once more before treating this corrected design as final."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1787608012707,"completed_at_ms":1787608014547}}
{"timestamp":"2026-08-24T21:46:54.548Z","ordinal":9697,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_068dffc2438c6825016a8cbbccadec87d0bee91748ca04236c","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"The design now keeps the product contract intact:\n\n- pre-push still offers Yes / Not now / Always;\n- `entire trust` and `--revoke` remain;\n- checkpoint egress still holds until consent and drains after consent;\n- Claude Code retains its current lifecycle/tool matchers;\n- Gemini retains all twelve current hook entries.\n\nOnly `enable --global`, `disable --global`, and the ask-once global-enable wizard are removed. The brainstorming review gate calls for rechecking a materially revised spec, so I’m doing that once more before treating this corrected design as final."}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a035bb-e411-7b32-a380-13e06970de42","create_time":1787608007.310907}}}
