{"timestamp":"2026-08-24T21:48:56.403Z","ordinal":9724,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a035bf-7ad2-7a10-b6ea-aee7076ce9b5","author":"/root/quality_audit","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/quality_audit\nPayload:\n## Spec Review\n\n**Status:** Approved\n\nNo blocking contradictions or regressions. The spec preserves trust/revoke, the three-choice pre-push flow, checkpoint hold/drain behavior, and complete Claude/Gemini hook coverage.\n\nTwo low-priority recommendations were sent:\n\n- Add an explicit check removing stale `enable --global` guidance.\n- Enumerate Claude’s eight hook entries as explicitly as Gemini’s twelve."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a035bb-e411-7b32-a380-13e06970de42","create_time":1787608136.402374}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-08-24T21:49:02.802Z","ordinal":9725,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_068dffc2438c6825016a8cbc4ad0f087d09cdf6d344b5ccb68","status":"completed","call_id":"call_iVQv9TU0IwopI6jKHHSCRBVE","name":"exec","input":"const patch = \"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /Users/peytonmontei/Documents/Documents - Peyton’s MacBook Pro/entire/devenv/entireio/cli/.worktrees/global-settings-tier/docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-24-settings-only-global-tracking-refactor-design.md\\n@@\\n event remain installed because their presence is part of the supported Gemini\\n integration contract. Claude Code likewise preserves its current lifecycle and\\n-tool-use matcher coverage. The refactor deduplicates how these entries are\\n-declared and reconciled; it does not prune or reinterpret them.\\n+tool-use matcher coverage: `SessionStart`, `SessionEnd`, `Stop`, `SubagentStop`,\\n+`UserPromptSubmit`, `PreToolUse[Agent]`, `PostToolUse[Agent]`, and\\n+`PostToolUse[TaskCreate|TaskUpdate]`. The refactor deduplicates how these entries\\n+are declared and reconciled; it does not prune or reinterpret them.\\n@@\\n - Accessible mode cannot grant consent implicitly or consume pre-push stdin;\\n   explicit Yes/Not now/Always choices retain their current effects.\\n+- A repository-wide user-facing-string check finds no remaining instructions to\\n+  run `entire enable --global` or `entire disable --global`; activation guidance\\n+  points to the resolved user settings file instead.\\n - `status`, `help`, `version`, `auth token`, and JSON inspection commands create\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a035bb-e411-7b32-a380-13e06970de42","create_time":1787608137.883015}}}
