{"timestamp":"2026-08-24T21:49:13.370Z","ordinal":9739,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a025ce-e754-7631-8467-eaa6035ba0f8","turn_id":"01a035bb-e411-7b32-a380-13e06970de42","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_068dffc2438c6825016a8cbc56d3a487d09171415383b6ef41","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"Yes—the corrected refactor preserves:\n\n- Pre-push trust with Yes / Not now / Always.\n- `entire trust` and `entire trust --revoke`.\n- Egress holding, consent, and checkpoint draining.\n- All 8 Claude Code hook entries.\n- All 12 Gemini hook entries, including currently no-op lifecycle events.\n- Existing repository-level enable/disable behavior.\n\nOnly global activation changes: `enable --global`, `disable --global`, and the ask-once activation wizard are removed. Global activation is configured through user `settings.json`.\n\nThe internal architecture is simplified and the reported security/correctness bugs are fixed without removing those product behaviors. The revised spec passed review; no production code has changed yet."}],"phase":"final_answer"},"started_at_ms":1787608150965,"completed_at_ms":1787608153370}}
