data but retains the disabled tombstone.\n \n","move_path":null}},"status":"completed","stdout":"Success. Updated the following files:\nM /Users/peytonmontei/Documents/Documents - Peyton’s MacBook Pro/entire/devenv/entireio/cli/.worktrees/global-settings-tier/docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-24-settings-only-global-tracking-refactor.md\n","stderr":""},"started_at_ms":1787608882125,"completed_at_ms":1787608882194}}
