{"timestamp":"2026-08-24T22:01:34.378Z","ordinal":9987,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_068dffc2438c6825016a8cbf393d3487d0b8a9a234e9de93ee","status":"completed","call_id":"call_trXIItIDMXpCsCmOVUPmlT9X","name":"exec","input":"const patch = \"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /Users/peytonmontei/Documents/Documents - Peyton’s MacBook Pro/entire/devenv/entireio/cli/.worktrees/global-settings-tier/docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-24-settings-only-global-tracking-refactor.md\\n@@\\n - Modify: `cmd/entire/cli/agent/geminicli/hooks_test.go`\\n - Modify: `cmd/entire/cli/agent/geminicli/hooks_user_test.go`\\n - Modify: `cmd/entire/cli/setup_global.go`\\n+- Modify: `cmd/entire/cli/setup.go`\\n+- Modify: `cmd/entire/cli/agent_group.go`\\n+- Modify: `cmd/entire/cli/agent_group_test.go`\\n@@\\n-User-hook reconciliation runs only from installer/update integration, `entire enable`, `entire agent add`, and confirmed doctor repair. It does not run inside hooks or read-only commands. Installation errors warn without changing global activation policy.\\n+User-hook reconciliation runs only from installer/update integration\\n+(`curl-bash-post-install`), `entire enable`, `entire agent add`, and confirmed\\n+doctor repair. `entire agent remove` removes that agent's user-scope Entire\\n+entries; repository disable/uninstall does not remove shared user-level\\n+infrastructure. Reconciliation does not run inside hooks or read-only commands.\\n+Installation errors warn without changing global activation policy.\\n@@\\n-git add cmd/entire/cli/agent cmd/entire/cli/setup_global.go\\n+git add cmd/entire/cli/agent cmd/entire/cli/agent_group.go cmd/entire/cli/agent_group_test.go cmd/entire/cli/setup.go cmd/entire/cli/setup_global.go\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a035c5-5c5e-7ca3-86ab-631a16cc0d4a","create_time":1787608887.50649}}}
