{"timestamp":"2026-08-24T22:01:39.614Z","ordinal":9994,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a025ce-e754-7631-8467-eaa6035ba0f8","turn_id":"01a035c5-5c5e-7ca3-86ab-631a16cc0d4a","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-9b3650f2-93ad-49d4-bd2e-cbce07e19f7d","process_id":"18870","command":["/bin/zsh","-lc","rg -n \"TODO|TBD|placeholder|enable --global|disable --global|Gemini must retain|Claude must retain|ACCESSIBLE|symlink|finding\" docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-24-settings-only-global-tracking-refactor.md && rg -n '[[:blank:]]+$' docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-24-settings-only-global-tracking-refactor.md || true"],"cwd":"file:///Users/peytonmontei/Documents/Documents%20-%20Peyton%E2%80%99s%20MacBook%20Pro/entire/devenv/entireio/cli/.worktrees/global-settings-tier","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"search","cmd":"rg -n 'TODO|TBD|placeholder|enable --global|disable --global|Gemini must retain|Claude must retain|ACCESSIBLE|symlink|finding' docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-24-settings-only-global-tracking-refactor.md","query":"TODO|TBD|placeholder|enable --global|disable --global|Gemini must retain|Claude must retain|ACCESSIBLE|symlink|finding","path":"2026-08-24-settings-only-global-tracking-refactor.md"},{"type":"search","cmd":"rg -n '[[:blank:]]+$' docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-24-settings-only-global-tracking-refactor.md","query":"[[:blank:]]+$","path":"2026-08-24-settings-only-global-tracking-refactor.md"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","stdout":"213:Accepted legacy evidence is only an exact-worktree active session record or one of the recognized, untracked, non-symlinked `.entire/metadata/<session-id>/` files named in the spec.\n246:Cover a fresh clone whose tracked or symlink-traversing `.entire` contains\n268:relative path from an already attacker-controlled symlink target.\n574:Claude must retain exactly these eight entries:\n587:Gemini must retain exactly twelve entries:\n775:9. tracked or symlinked `.entire` cannot unlock executable settings or egress;\n793:rg -n \"runEnableGlobalMode|runDisableGlobalMode|maybePromptGlobalTracking|maybeMigrateGlobalRuntimeData|migration gate|GlobalSetupCompleted|enable --global|disable --global\" --glob '!docs/superpowers/**'\n841:Use `entire:review` for intent-aware review, then `superpowers:requesting-code-review`. Address every valid finding and rerun the relevant focused test plus `mise run check` before any fixing commit.\n849:Before the authorized remote update, run `mise run lint` again. Update `feat/global-trust` with `--force-with-lease`, update the PR/trail body to describe the single coherent feature, then wait for every repository/PR gate to reach terminal state. Compare pre/post risk and security classifications, inspect every failure/degradation, fix valid findings, and repeat until stable. Resolve trail findings only after their implementation and regression tests are present remotely.\n","stderr":"","aggregated_output":"213:Accepted legacy evidence is only an exact-worktree active session record or one of the recognized, untracked, non-symlinked `.entire/metadata/<session-id>/` files named in the spec.\n246:Cover a fresh clone whose tracked or symlink-traversing `.entire` contains\n268:relative path from an already attacker-controlled symlink target.\n574:Claude must retain exactly these eight entries:\n587:Gemini must retain exactly twelve entries:\n775:9. tracked or symlinked `.entire` cannot unlock executable settings or egress;\n793:rg -n \"runEnableGlobalMode|runDisableGlobalMode|maybePromptGlobalTracking|maybeMigrateGlobalRuntimeData|migration gate|GlobalSetupCompleted|enable --global|disable --global\" --glob '!docs/superpowers/**'\n841:Use `entire:review` for intent-aware review, then `superpowers:requesting-code-review`. Address every valid finding and rerun the relevant focused test plus `mise run check` before any fixing commit.\n849:Before the authorized remote update, run `mise run lint` again. Update `feat/global-trust` with `--force-with-lease`, update the PR/trail body to describe the single coherent feature, then wait for every repository/PR gate to reach terminal state. Compare pre/post risk and security classifications, inspect every failure/degradation, fix valid findings, and repeat until stable. Resolve trail findings only after their implementation and regression tests are present remotely.\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":3416},"formatted_output":"213:Accepted legacy evidence is only an exact-worktree active session record or one of the recognized, untracked, non-symlinked `.entire/metadata/<session-id>/` files named in the spec.\n246:Cover a fresh clone whose tracked or symlink-traversing `.entire` contains\n268:relative path from an already attacker-controlled symlink target.\n574:Claude must retain exactly these eight entries:\n587:Gemini must retain exactly twelve entries:\n775:9. tracked or symlinked `.entire` cannot unlock executable settings or egress;\n793:rg -n \"runEnableGlobalMode|runDisableGlobalMode|maybePromptGlobalTracking|maybeMigrateGlobalRuntimeData|migration gate|GlobalSetupCompleted|enable --global|disable --global\" --glob '!docs/superpowers/**'\n841:Use `entire:review` for intent-aware review, then `superpowers:requesting-code-review`. Address every valid finding and rerun the relevant focused test plus `mise run check` before any fixing commit.\n849:Before the authorized remote update, run `mise run lint` again. Update `feat/global-trust` with `--force-with-lease`, update the PR/trail body to describe the single coherent feature, then wait for every repository/PR gate to reach terminal state. Compare pre/post risk and security classifications, inspect every failure/degradation, fix valid findings, and repeat until stable. Resolve trail findings only after their implementation and regression tests are present remotely.\n"},"started_at_ms":1787608899614,"completed_at_ms":1787608899614}}
{"timestamp":"2026-08-24T22:01:39.676Z","ordinal":9995,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a035cb-205c-7271-95f8-9f7fc55eff49","call_id":"call_AgWqIBt6clreThEqpazcbImG","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.1 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"54a7fe\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.000003416,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":353,\"output\":\"213:Accepted legacy evidence is only an exact-worktree active session record or one of the recognized, untracked, non-symlinked `.entire/metadata/<session-id>/` files named in the spec.\\n246:Cover a fresh clone whose tracked or symlink-traversing `.entire` contains\\n268:relative path from an already attacker-controlled symlink target.\\n574:Claude must retain exactly these eight entries:\\n587:Gemini must retain exactly twelve entries:\\n775:9. tracked or symlinked `.entire` cannot unlock executable settings or egress;\\n793:rg -n \\\"runEnableGlobalMode|runDisableGlobalMode|maybePromptGlobalTracking|maybeMigrateGlobalRuntimeData|migration gate|GlobalSetupCompleted|enable --global|disable --global\\\" --glob '!docs/superpowers/**'\\n841:Use `entire:review` for intent-aware review, then `superpowers:requesting-code-review`. Address every valid finding and rerun the relevant focused test plus `mise run check` before any fixing commit.\\n849:Before the authorized remote update, run `mise run lint` again. Update `feat/global-trust` with `--force-with-lease`, update the PR/trail body to describe the single coherent feature, then wait for every repository/PR gate to reach terminal state. Compare pre/post risk and security classifications, inspect every failure/degradation, fix valid findings, and repeat until stable. Resolve trail findings only after their implementation and regression tests are present remotely.\\n\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a035c5-5c5e-7ca3-86ab-631a16cc0d4a","create_time