{"timestamp":"2026-08-24T23:30:39.612Z","ordinal":10864,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a0361c-9b7c-7a03-8c25-7af52fe6b3e9","author":"/root/task1_policy_inputs","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/task1_policy_inputs\nPayload:\nImplemented and committed all three quality fixes.\n\nSummary:\n\n- Enforced strict JSON EOF handling after the first decoded settings object.\n- Added regression coverage for trailing junk and multiple JSON values.\n- Removed raw origin values from normalization errors to prevent credential leaks.\n- Restored detailed `GlobalConfig` field documentation without changing its JSON schema.\n\nVerification:\n\n- RED: focused tests failed for all three regressions.\n- GREEN: focused tests passed.\n- `go test ./cmd/entire/cli/settings/repopolicy ./cmd/entire/cli/settings -count=1` passed.\n- `CI=true mise run check` passed, including race/integration tests and deterministic E2E canaries.\n- `golangci-lint run --timeout=30m ./...` passed with `0 issues`.\n- Worktree is clean.\n\nCommit: `7bec624cf4dfbeea27aaeb09c257c2291ee8c936`  \nMessage: `fix(settings): enforce strict global policy inputs`\n\nNo push performed."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a035c5-5c5e-7ca3-86ab-631a16cc0d4a","create_time":1787614239.612562}}}
