{"timestamp":"2026-08-25T00:08:09.556Z","ordinal":11176,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a025ce-e754-7631-8467-eaa6035ba0f8","turn_id":"01a035c5-5c5e-7ca3-86ab-631a16cc0d4a","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_068dffc2438c6825016a8cdce76a8887d0a978158bdacc039a","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"`★ Insight ─────────────────────────────────────`\nTask 2 now makes activation provenance and storage placement machine-local, versioned, identity-bound, and per worktree. A copied/tracked `.entire` directory cannot silently confer consent, and a short hash is never trusted without verifying the full canonical worktree and Git-common identities.\n\nThe sanitized hook loader is typed and exhaustive: adding a future settings field will fail tests until it is explicitly classified as allowed or ignored for global-only execution.\n`─────────────────────────────────────────────────`\n\nTask 2 is committed locally and the full gate is green. I’m now reviewing the actual commit for exact behavioral compliance before the separate production-quality pass."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1787616487461,"completed_at_ms":1787616489556}}
