{"timestamp":"2026-08-25T00:15:09.001Z","ordinal":11234,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a025ce-e754-7631-8467-eaa6035ba0f8","turn_id":"01a035c5-5c5e-7ca3-86ab-631a16cc0d4a","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_068dffc2438c6825016a8cde8b93e487d0a711be00a1d54f0c","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The compliance review caught six real gaps:\n\n- legacy bootstrap still treated an installed Git hook as consent;\n- session evidence accepted any phase except `\"ended\"`;\n- `null` PII categories became `false`, weakening redaction defaults;\n- `null` scalar fields were accepted as valid hook settings;\n- the cancellation test never actually waited on the route lock;\n- directory sync was not Windows-safe, and registry-path ownership was still duplicated.\n\nThese are all Task 2 contract issues, so I’m fixing them before any quality review."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1787616907630,"completed_at_ms":1787616909001}}
{"timestamp":"2026-08-25T00:15:09.003Z","ordinal":11235,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_068dffc2438c6825016a8cde8b93e487d0a711be00a1d54f0c","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"The compliance review caught six real gaps:\n\n- legacy bootstrap still treated an installed Git hook as consent;\n- session evidence accepted any phase except `\"ended\"`;\n- `null` PII categories became `false`, weakening redaction defaults;\n- `null` scalar fields were accepted as valid hook settings;\n- the cancellation test never actually waited on the route lock;\n- directory sync was not Windows-safe, and registry-path ownership was still duplicated.\n\nThese are all Task 2 contract issues, so I’m fixing them before any quality review."}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a035c5-5c5e-7ca3-86ab-631a16cc0d4a","create_time":1787616905.111667}}}
