{"timestamp":"2026-08-25T00:33:23.841Z","ordinal":11366,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a03656-0b80-7421-b7b0-71970646adad","author":"/root/task2_sticky_routing","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/task2_sticky_routing\nPayload:\nFixed all seven review gaps in follow-up commit:\n\n`286ee984c33b3149f276508a920238db3d8d7273`  \n`fix(global): harden activation and route provenance`\n\nKey changes:\n\n- Removed Git hooks as legacy activation evidence.\n- Restricted session evidence to `active` and established legacy `active_committed`; missing, idle, ended, and unknown phases reject.\n- Preserved PII category `true`/`false`/`null` pointer semantics exactly.\n- Rejected null and invalid types for non-nullable allowed hook fields.\n- Reworked cancellation coverage to use genuine route-lock contention and verify no publication.\n- Added cross-platform `jsonutil.SyncDir`: strict POSIX durability with Windows unsupported-sync tolerance.\n- Centralized `entire/worktree/<key>` construction in `repopolicy`; paths delegates to it.\n\nRED evidence:\n\n- Hook-only and missing/idle/unknown session evidence incorrectly activated.\n- PII null became `&false`.\n- Null enabled, log level, externalize-images, and PII-enabled values were accepted.\n- `SyncDir` tests initially failed to compile because the helper did not exist.\n- The strengthened contention test passed immediately, confirming existing production cancellation behavior required no injection.\n\nVerification:\n\n- Exact mandated focused suite: passed.\n- Full affected packages: passed.\n- Windows amd64 cross-compile for `jsonutil`, `repopolicy`, `settings`, and `paths`: passed.\n- `mise run dup`: completed; 922 repository-wide advisories, with no matches in changed production files.\n- Post-format lint: zero issues.\n- Final `mise run check`: passed, including race/integration tests, Vogon 56/56, and Roger-Roger 4/4.\n- Final staged diff and whitespace audit: clean.\n\nNo amend or push performed. Branch/worktree preserved; working tree is clean aside from unchanged ignored `docs/superpowers/`."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a035c5-5c5e-7ca3-86ab-631a16cc0d4a","create_time":1787618003.840759}}}
