{"timestamp":"2026-08-25T00:43:05.812Z","ordinal":11448,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a025ce-e754-7631-8467-eaa6035ba0f8","turn_id":"01a035c5-5c5e-7ca3-86ab-631a16cc0d4a","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_068dffc2438c6825016a8ce517485c87d080bf635f8c7f6af4","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The quality pass found four production issues plus two correctness hardening items:\n\n- a genuine check-then-open race in settings/legacy provenance;\n- registry directory creation was not itself crash-durable;\n- legacy metadata could spawn one Git process per candidate;\n- Unix permission assertions would fail on native Windows;\n- null maps lost nil semantics;\n- future PII fields were not exhaustively classified.\n\nI’m sending the full set back now. The provenance fix must bind validation to the same opened file—not merely add another pre-read check."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1787618583329,"completed_at_ms":1787618585812}}
{"timestamp":"2026-08-25T00:43:05.814Z","ordinal":11449,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_068dffc2438c6825016a8ce517485c87d080bf635f8c7f6af4","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"The quality pass found four production issues plus two correctness hardening items:\n\n- a genuine check-then-open race in settings/legacy provenance;\n- registry directory creation was not itself crash-durable;\n- legacy metadata could spawn one Git process per candidate;\n- Unix permission assertions would fail on native Windows;\n- null maps lost nil semantics;\n- future PII fields were not exhaustively classified.\n\nI’m sending the full set back now. The provenance fix must bind validation to the same opened file—not merely add another pre-read check."}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a035c5-5c5e-7ca3-86ab-631a16cc0d4a","create_time":1787618564.176516}}}
