{"timestamp":"2026-08-25T01:01:26.420Z","ordinal":11574,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a025ce-e754-7631-8467-eaa6035ba0f8","turn_id":"01a035c5-5c5e-7ca3-86ab-631a16cc0d4a","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_068dffc2438c6825016a8ce964bcd887d0b305faa62cf47dcc","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The implementation has settled on a cycle-safe `internal/gitpath` helper for the trackedness portion, while `repopolicy` owns the canonical-root safe-open/provenance result. That keeps Git path queries reusable without letting the parent settings package reopen files by name. Focused regression coverage is still being completed."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1787619684774,"completed_at_ms":1787619686420}}
