{"timestamp":"2026-08-25T01:15:32.392Z","ordinal":11671,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a0367c-a0a8-76b0-b610-1d82c0d1b2c2","author":"/root/task2_sticky_routing","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/task2_sticky_routing\nPayload:\nCompleted and committed the quality-review fixes.\n\nCommit: `060771a685a657d6742b0eda85115d7fb38d704f`  \nMessage: `fix(global): secure provenance and durable routing`\n\nKey changes:\n\n- Root-anchored, identity-bound settings reads; parent loaders consume verified bytes without reopening paths.\n- Same secure-open behavior for legacy session and metadata evidence.\n- Durable registry hierarchy creation with parent-directory syncs.\n- One bounded Git metadata query and incremental 250 ms filesystem scan.\n- Windows-safe permission assertions.\n- Correct nil-versus-empty hook map behavior.\n- Exhaustive `PIISettings` hook-field classification.\n- Shared filesystem-equivalent Git path comparison preserving case/trailing-dot security semantics.\n\nTDD evidence:\n\n- Initial RED: new secure-read, durable registry, bounded metadata, nil-map, and PII contracts failed to compile before implementation.\n- Adversarial legacy swap tests failed before their per-call seams existed.\n- Filesystem-equivalent tracked local test failed for both case variants and trailing-dot variants before the shared comparison fix.\n- All became GREEN.\n\nVerification:\n\n- Exact mandated focused suite: passed.\n- Full affected package suites: passed.\n- Relevant race suite, 3 repetitions: passed.\n- Windows amd64 compilation for all affected packages: passed.\n- `mise run dup`: completed; only the existing repository-wide advisory backlog, with no duplicate block in changed production files.\n- Final `mise run check`: passed.\n  - Formatting passed.\n  - Lint: 0 issues.\n  - Repository-wide integration/race tests passed.\n  - Vogon canary: 56/56 passed.\n  - Roger-Roger canary: 4/4 passed.\n- `git diff --check`: clean.\n- Working tree: clean.\n\nChanged 11 files, including the new cycle-safe `cmd/entire/cli/internal/gitpath` helper and tests. No ignored spec/plan documents were modified or committed. No push performed."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a035c5-5c5e-7ca3-86ab-631a16cc0d4a","create_time":1787620532.392056}}}
