{"timestamp":"2026-08-25T01:22:29.649Z","ordinal":11726,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a025ce-e754-7631-8467-eaa6035ba0f8","turn_id":"01a035c5-5c5e-7ca3-86ab-631a16cc0d4a","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_068dffc2438c6825016a8cee52c97c87d0b6dc620f21b628fa","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The re-review found a consent-boundary bypass on case-insensitive filesystems: settings trackedness used conservative filesystem-equivalent matching, but legacy metadata trackedness still used exact strings. A committed case alias could therefore look untracked and bootstrap activation.\n\nIt also found an availability regression: Git ownership-query failures discarded safely opened local settings entirely, instead of preserving non-executable local preferences while failing closed only for trust-sensitive use. Both need correction before Task 2 is complete."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1787620946839,"completed_at_ms":1787620949649}}
{"timestamp":"2026-08-25T01:22:29.650Z","ordinal":11727,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_068dffc2438c6825016a8cee52c97c87d0b6dc620f21b628fa","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"The re-review found a consent-boundary bypass on case-insensitive filesystems: settings trackedness used conservative filesystem-equivalent matching, but legacy metadata trackedness still used exact strings. A committed case alias could therefore look untracked and bootstrap activation.\n\nIt also found an availability regression: Git ownership-query failures discarded safely opened local settings entirely, instead of preserving non-executable local preferences while failing closed only for trust-sensitive use. Both need correction before Task 2 is complete."}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a035c5-5c5e-7ca3-86ab-631a16cc0d4a","create_time":1787620933.663626}}}
