{"timestamp":"2026-08-25T02:32:44.909Z","ordinal":11964,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a036c3-506d-7c42-8da0-11786f379576","author":"/root/task2_quality_review","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/task2_quality_review\nPayload:\n### Strengths\n\n- Metadata ownership now uses conservative canonical keys across one 500 ms-bounded full-index query, closing case and trailing-dot aliases without unsafe collision behavior.\n- Tri-state ownership correctly separates ordinary local, global-only, and OPF settings. Unknown ownership preserves local preferences and `enabled:false`, while global and executable consumers fail closed.\n- Verified bytes remain bound to the same opened object through pre/open/post identity checks.\n- Cancellation is checked before and between filesystem operations; the cooperative limitation during an active syscall is explicitly documented.\n- Adversarial alias, ownership-error, OPF, local-veto, and file-swap tests meaningfully cover the security decisions.\n- Focused race tests passed, all affected packages cross-compiled for Windows/amd64, and `git diff --check` passed.\n\n### Issues\n\n#### Critical\n\nNone.\n\n#### Important\n\nNone.\n\n#### Minor\n\nNone.\n\n### Recommendations\n\n- Add native Windows runtime tests when available to validate actual NTFS alias, permission, and directory-sync behavior beyond cross-compilation.\n- Monitor the 500 ms full-index bootstrap query in very large repositories; its breadth is security-conservative and bounded, but telemetry could identify migration failures caused by the limit.\n\n### Assessment\n\nReady to proceed? Yes. The previously reported consent bypass, ownership regression, and cancellation gap are fixed with appropriate fail-closed semantics and meaningful regression coverage."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a035c5-5c5e-7ca3-86ab-631a16cc0d4a","create_time":1787625164.909474}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-08-25T02:32:47.857Z","ordinal":11965,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a025ce-e754-7631-8467-eaa6035ba0f8","turn_id":"01a035c5-5c5e-7ca3-86ab-631a16cc0d4a","item":{"type":"Reasoning","id":"rs_068dffc2438c6825016a8cfecf5a3887d08adaa93c85d1faa1","summary_text":[],"raw_content":[]},"started_at_ms":1787625167382,"completed_at_ms":1787625167857}}
