{"timestamp":"2026-08-25T02:32:49.722Z","ordinal":11967,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a025ce-e754-7631-8467-eaa6035ba0f8","turn_id":"01a035c5-5c5e-7ca3-86ab-631a16cc0d4a","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_068dffc2438c6825016a8cfecfd2f087d0ab2faf07b2436ed3","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"`★ Insight ─────────────────────────────────────`\nTask 2 now has a clean trust lattice: securely opened bytes, ownership state (`tracked`, `untracked`, `unknown`), and consumer class are separate facts. Ordinary locally activated preferences tolerate unknown ownership; global-only and executable OPF consumers require proven-untracked provenance.\n\nBoth Task 2 review gates now pass with zero findings. The activation and sticky-route foundation is ready for call-site integration and removal of the obsolete global command/wizard/migration surface.\n`─────────────────────────────────────────────────`\n\nI’m proceeding to Task 3: wire explicit enable/disable to activation records and delete the `--global`/wizard/takeover machinery without disturbing trust or agent-hook behavior."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1787625167860,"completed_at_ms":1787625169722}}
{"timestamp":"2026-08-25T02:32:49.723Z","ordinal":11968,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_068dffc2438c6825016a8cfecfd2f087d0ab2faf07b2436ed3","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"`★ Insight ─────────────────────────────────────`\nTask 2 now has a clean trust lattice: securely opened bytes, ownership state (`tracked`, `untracked`, `unknown`), and consumer class are separate facts. Ordinary locally activated preferences tolerate unknown ownership; global-only and executable OPF consumers require proven-untracked provenance.\n\nBoth Task 2 review gates now pass with zero findings. The activation and sticky-route foundation is ready for call-site integration and removal of the obsolete global command/wizard/migration surface.\n`─────────────────────────────────────────────────`\n\nI’m proceeding to Task 3: wire explicit enable/disable to activation records and delete the `--global`/wizard/takeover machinery without disturbing trust or agent-hook behavior."}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a035c5-5c5e-7ca3-86ab-631a16cc0d4a","create_time":1787625165.412678}}}
