{"timestamp":"2026-08-25T02:55:36.088Z","ordinal":12102,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a025ce-e754-7631-8467-eaa6035ba0f8","turn_id":"01a035c5-5c5e-7ca3-86ab-631a16cc0d4a","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_068dffc2438c6825016a8d0426743c87d081c1bf8f291c21a2","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The obsolete command, wizard, hint, and takeover-migration surfaces are removed. Explicit enable now follows the planned order and carries a policy snapshot into setup. Trust logic and user-level Claude/Gemini hook code remain untouched; only impossible recovery copy now directs users to `settings.json`.\n\nI’ve flagged one subtle disable invariant: disabling must retain an existing route, but must not invent a route for a worktree that never had runtime data."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1787626534488,"completed_at_ms":1787626536088}}
{"timestamp":"2026-08-25T02:55:36.093Z","ordinal":12103,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_068dffc2438c6825016a8d0426743c87d081c1bf8f291c21a2","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"The obsolete command, wizard, hint, and takeover-migration surfaces are removed. Explicit enable now follows the planned order and carries a policy snapshot into setup. Trust logic and user-level Claude/Gemini hook code remain untouched; only impossible recovery copy now directs users to `settings.json`.\n\nI’ve flagged one subtle disable invariant: disabling must retain an existing route, but must not invent a route for a worktree that never had runtime data."}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a035c5-5c5e-7ca3-86ab-631a16cc0d4a","create_time":1787626532.501994}}}
