ation_test.go:110:// TestMigrateShadowBranch_ReconcileClearsDivergenceFlag verifies that the reconcile\ncmd/entire/cli/strategy/manual_commit_migration_test.go:128:\t\tSessionID:             \"test-session-reconcile-flag\",\ncmd/entire/cli/strategy/manual_commit_migration_test.go:141:\t\t\"reconcile must clear DivergenceNoticeShown so future divergence can warn again\")\ncmd/entire/cli/strategy/manual_commit_migration_test.go:180:// the migrate path fires instead of reconcile, and AttributionBaseCommit stays pinned.\ncmd/entire/cli/strategy/manual_commit_migration_test.go:209:\tassert.Equal(t, initHash, state.AttributionBaseCommit, \"AttributionBaseCommit should stay pinned (migrate, not reconcile)\")\ncmd/entire/cli/strategy/manual_commit_migration_test.go:213:// has never been condensed (LastCheckpointID is empty), the reconcile guard is\ncmd/entire/cli/strategy/manual_commit_migration_test.go:244:// TestMigrateShadowBranch_MultiTrailerHEAD verifies that the reconcile path\ncmd/entire/cli/strategy/manual_commit_migration_test.go:273:\tassert.True(t, migrated, \"reconcile should fire on multi-trailer match\")\ncmd/entire/cli/strategy/manual_commit_migration_test.go:275:\tassert.Equal(t, headHash, state.AttributionBaseCommit, \"AttributionBaseCommit should advance (reconcile path)\")\ncmd/entire/cli/strategy/phase_wiring_test.go:305:// LastCheckpointID, reconcile advances BaseCommit + AttributionBaseCommit to\ncmd/entire/cli/strategy/phase_wiring_test.go:312:// (stale) with LastCheckpointID=X. InitializeSession must reconcile and\ncmd/entire/cli/strategy/phase_wiring_test.go:339:\t\tSessionID:             \"test-reconcile-attrib\",\ncmd/entire/cli/strategy/phase_wiring_test.go:357:\t\t\"reconcile must advance BaseCommit to HEAD (= C1)\")\ncmd/entire/cli/strategy/phase_wiring_test.go:359:\t\t\"reconcile must advance AttributionBaseCommit to HEAD (= C1)\")\ncmd/entire/cli/strategy/phase_wiring_test.go:363:\t// Correct attribution against the post-reconcile base (C1):\