{"timestamp":"2026-08-25T05:15:16.143Z","ordinal":13420,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a025ce-e754-7631-8467-eaa6035ba0f8","turn_id":"01a0371f-4feb-7263-aacd-7041d40b862c","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_068dffc2438c6825016a8d24e3365c87d09111ca3aa81a3d11","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"`★ Insight ─────────────────────────────────────`\nGemini already has one 12-entry declarative inventory; Claude still reconstructs its eight-entry contract in several manual lists. Converting Claude to the same “one spec, multiple consumers” shape prevents install, repair, removal, and diagnostics from drifting apart.\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────`"}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1787634915238,"completed_at_ms":1787634916143}}
