{"timestamp":"2026-08-25T05:22:20.508Z","ordinal":13618,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a025ce-e754-7631-8467-eaa6035ba0f8","turn_id":"01a0371f-4feb-7263-aacd-7041d40b862c","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_068dffc2438c6825016a8d268a6b0087d09f22b4ed68f07868","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"Claude and Gemini now have exact 8/12 inventories, bounded config-file locking, selected-agent installation, installer/update repair for detected agents only, explicit `agent remove` cleanup, and confirmed/`doctor --force` repair. Repository disable/uninstall still leaves shared user-level infrastructure intact.\n\n`★ Insight ─────────────────────────────────────`\nUser-level hooks are infrastructure, while repository activation is policy. Keeping those lifecycles separate lets a hook exist machine-wide but exit immediately when `settings.json` says global tracking is off or the repository is excluded.\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────`"}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1787635338455,"completed_at_ms":1787635340508}}
{"timestamp":"2026-08-25T05:22:20.509Z","ordinal":13619,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_068dffc2438c6825016a8d268a6b0087d09f22b4ed68f07868","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"Claude and Gemini now have exact 8/12 inventories, bounded config-file locking, selected-agent installation, installer/update repair for detected agents only, explicit `agent remove` cleanup, and confirmed/`doctor --force` repair. Repository disable/uninstall still leaves shared user-level infrastructure intact.\n\n`★ Insight ─────────────────────────────────────`\nUser-level hooks are infrastructure, while repository activation is policy. Keeping those lifecycles separate lets a hook exist machine-wide but exit immediately when `settings.json` says global tracking is off or the repository is excluded.\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────`"}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a0371f-4feb-7263-aacd-7041d40b862c","create_time":1787635337.009689}}}
