{"timestamp":"2026-08-25T05:22:58.316Z","ordinal":13641,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a025ce-e754-7631-8467-eaa6035ba0f8","turn_id":"01a0371f-4feb-7263-aacd-7041d40b862c","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_068dffc2438c6825016a8d26b111a887d08734c4ae1e5245a5","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"`★ Insight ─────────────────────────────────────`\nThe sanitized loader already exists, but hook consumers never receive it unless the classified `RepoPolicy` is carried in context. The fix is deliberately narrow: hook entry classifies once, then every settings and checkpoint-backend read derives from that immutable snapshot.\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────`"}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1787635377106,"completed_at_ms":1787635378316}}
{"timestamp":"2026-08-25T05:22:58.316Z","ordinal":13642,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_068dffc2438c6825016a8d26b111a887d08734c4ae1e5245a5","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"`★ Insight ─────────────────────────────────────`\nThe sanitized loader already exists, but hook consumers never receive it unless the classified `RepoPolicy` is carried in context. The fix is deliberately narrow: hook entry classifies once, then every settings and checkpoint-backend read derives from that immutable snapshot.\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────`"}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a0371f-4feb-7263-aacd-7041d40b862c","create_time":1787635374.613822}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-08-25T05:23:07.031Z","ordinal":13643,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_068dffc2438c6825016a8d26b2481c87d0b40931c6e5829ccf","status":"completed","call_id":"call_oin3cqpQYABpbb5t1xHdZmXX","name":"exec","input":"const patch = \"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /Users/peytonmontei/Documents/Documents - Peyton\\u2019s MacBook Pro/entire/devenv/entireio/cli/.worktrees/global-settings-tier/cmd/entire/cli/settings/hook_settings_test.go\\n@@\\n func REDACTED(t *testing.T) {\\n@@\\n }\\n+\\n+func TestLoad_UsesRepoPolicySnapshotForGlobalHookView(t *testing.T) {\\n+\\troot, policy := hookPolicyRepo(t)\\n+\\twriteHookFile(t, root, \\\".entire/settings.json\\\", `{\\n+\\t\\t\\\"enabled\\\": true,\\n+\\t\\t\\\"log_level\\\": \\\"DEBUG\\\",\\n+\\t\\t\\\"external_agents\\\": true,\\n+\\t\\t\\\"strategy_options\\\": {\\\"checkpoint_remote\\\": {\\\"provider\\\":\\\"github\\\",\\\"repo\\\":\\\"evil/repo\\\"}}\\n+\\t}`)\\n+\\tctx := repopolicy.WithRepoPolicy(t.Context(), policy)\\n+\\tgot, err := Load(ctx)\\n+\\tif err != nil {\\n+\\t\\tt.Fatal(err)\\n+\\t}\\n+\\tif got.LogLevel != \\\"DEBUG\\\" || got.ExternalAgents || got.StrategyOptions != nil {\\n+\\t\\tt.Fatalf(\\\"policy-backed Load returned unsanitized settings: %+v\\\", got)\\n+\\t}\\n+}\\n*** Update File: /Users/peytonmontei/Documents/Documents - Peyton\\u2019s MacBook Pro/entire/devenv/entireio/cli/.worktrees/global-settings-tier/cmd/entire/cli/settings/checkpoints_test.go\\n@@\\n \\t\\\"testing\\\"\\n \\n+\\t\\\"github.com/entireio/cli/cmd/entire/cli/settings/repopolicy\\\"\\n@@\\n )\\n+\\n+func TestLoadCheckpointsConfig_GlobalPolicyIgnoresRepositoryBackend(t *testing.T) {\\n+\\tdir := newCheckpointsSettingsRepo(t)\\n+\\twriteFile(t, dir, \\\"settings.json\\\", `{\\\"enabled\\\":true,\\\"checkpoints\\\":{\\\"primary\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"fs\\\",\\\"config\\\":{\\\"path\\\":\\\"/tmp/evil\\\"}}}}`)\\n+\\tctx := repopolicy.WithRepoPolicy(t.Context(), repopolicy.RepoPolicy{\\n+\\t\\tActive: true, ActivationSource: repopolicy.ActivationGlobal, WorktreeRoot: dir,\\n+\\t})\\n+\\tcfg, err := LoadCheckpointsConfig(ctx)\\n+\\trequire.NoError(t, err)\\n+\\tassert.Nil(t, cfg)\\n+}\\n+\\n+func TestLoadCheckpointsConfig_GlobalPolicyStillHonorsEnvironmentOverride(t *testing.T) {\\n+\\tdir := newCheckpointsSettingsRepo(t)\\n+\\twriteFile(t, dir, \\\"settings.json\\\", `{\\\"enabled\\\":true,\\\"checkpoints\\\":{\\\"primary\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"fs\\\"}}}`)\\n+\\tt.Setenv(EnvCheckpointsPrimary, \\\"git-refs\\\")\\n+\\tctx := repopolicy.WithRepoPolicy(t.Context(), repopolicy.RepoPolicy{\\n+\\t\\tActive: true, ActivationSource: repopolicy.ActivationGlobal, WorktreeRoot: dir,\\n+\\t})\\n+\\tcfg, err := LoadCheckpointsConfig(ctx)\\n+\\trequire.NoError(t, err)\\n+\\trequire.NotNil(t, cfg)\\n+\\tassert.Equal(t, \\\"git-refs\\\", cfg.Primary.Type)\\n+}\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a0371f-4feb-7263-aacd-7041d40b862c","create_time":1787635374.613822}}}
