{"timestamp":"2026-08-25T05:35:42.287Z","ordinal":13938,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a025ce-e754-7631-8467-eaa6035ba0f8","turn_id":"01a0371f-4feb-7263-aacd-7041d40b862c","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_068dffc2438c6825016a8d29ace7d487d08db48cda40e282ad","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"`★ Insight ─────────────────────────────────────`\n- Hook commands now classify repository policy once, then every settings, route, backend, and trust decision reads that immutable snapshot from context.\n- Status and doctor need the same consistency without creating routes; their classification must remain strictly read-only, with repairs occurring only after explicit confirmation or `--force`.\n`─────────────────────────────────────────────────`"}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1787636140942,"completed_at_ms":1787636142287}}
