{"timestamp":"2026-08-25T05:36:54.689Z","ordinal":13965,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a025ce-e754-7631-8467-eaa6035ba0f8","turn_id":"01a0371f-4feb-7263-aacd-7041d40b862c","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_068dffc2438c6825016a8d29f510c087d091070422e9947071","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"`★ Insight ─────────────────────────────────────`\n- Status now derives activation, runtime layout, and trust from one read-only policy object, avoiding contradictory results if settings change mid-command.\n- Doctor shares that snapshot for diagnostics but still cannot create a runtime route; only its existing confirmed repair branches write hook configuration.\n`─────────────────────────────────────────────────`\n\nThe complete CLI package now passes after this wiring. I’m moving straight into obsolete-code cleanup and integration coverage."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1787636213116,"completed_at_ms":1787636214689}}
