{"timestamp":"2026-08-25T16:39:10.892Z","ordinal":14391,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a025ce-e754-7631-8467-eaa6035ba0f8","turn_id":"01a039b7-b242-7af0-80e0-d29bf9afbbac","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_068dffc2438c6825016a8dc52da6f087d08c6119de5fd0bf51","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"`★ Insight ─────────────────────────────────────`\n- Setup only needs `EnsureRuntimeRoute` to persist the sticky record; it deliberately reclassifies after recording local activation, so retaining the intermediate policy value is unnecessary.\n- User-hook lock failures cross package boundaries and need agent-specific context, otherwise doctor/install errors do not identify which configuration was locked.\n`─────────────────────────────────────────────────`"}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1787675949710,"completed_at_ms":1787675950892}}
{"timestamp":"2026-08-25T16:39:10.895Z","ordinal":14392,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_068dffc2438c6825016a8dc52da6f087d08c6119de5fd0bf51","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"`★ Insight ─────────────────────────────────────`\n- Setup only needs `EnsureRuntimeRoute` to persist the sticky record; it deliberately reclassifies after recording local activation, so retaining the intermediate policy value is unnecessary.\n- User-hook lock failures cross package boundaries and need agent-specific context, otherwise doctor/install errors do not identify which configuration was locked.\n`─────────────────────────────────────────────────`"}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a039b7-b242-7af0-80e0-d29bf9afbbac","create_time":1787675947.70175}}}
