{"timestamp":"2026-08-25T16:39:50.030Z","ordinal":14399,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a025ce-e754-7631-8467-eaa6035ba0f8","turn_id":"01a039b7-b242-7af0-80e0-d29bf9afbbac","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_068dffc2438c6825016a8dc554fa7887d083ae6b2778df2d33","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"`★ Insight ─────────────────────────────────────`\n- The setup flow now makes its persistence intent explicit and avoids implying that an intermediate policy snapshot is reused.\n- Lock errors now identify Claude Code versus Gemini CLI, which makes doctor’s repair output actionable without exposing config contents.\n`─────────────────────────────────────────────────`"}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1787675989014,"completed_at_ms":1787675990030}}
