{"timestamp":"2026-08-25T18:22:31.317Z","ordinal":15023,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a025ce-e754-7631-8467-eaa6035ba0f8","turn_id":"01a03a26-cc3b-7a63-ae24-bd96456161c3","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_068dffc2438c6825016a8ddd65c2fc87d0b88a6c11a94ef6e1","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The consent transaction is now fail-safe and the focused tests pass. Repository relocation and trust/revoke share one cross-process lock; the ledger is cleared before touching `settings.json`, so partial failure cannot later delete a user-authored grant.\n\n`★ Insight ─────────────────────────────────────`\nThe lock alone prevents races, but ordering handles crashes. Clearing ownership first deliberately trades automatic cleanup for consent safety if a process dies between the two atomic file writes.\n`─────────────────────────────────────────────────`"}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1787682149839,"completed_at_ms":1787682151317}}
{"timestamp":"2026-08-25T18:22:31.318Z","ordinal":15024,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_068dffc2438c6825016a8ddd65c2fc87d0b88a6c11a94ef6e1","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"The consent transaction is now fail-safe and the focused tests pass. Repository relocation and trust/revoke share one cross-process lock; the ledger is cleared before touching `settings.json`, so partial failure cannot later delete a user-authored grant.\n\n`★ Insight ─────────────────────────────────────`\nThe lock alone prevents races, but ordering handles crashes. Clearing ownership first deliberately trades automatic cleanup for consent safety if a process dies between the two atomic file writes.\n`─────────────────────────────────────────────────`"}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a03a26-cc3b-7a63-ae24-bd96456161c3","create_time":1787682146.385562}}}
